{"word":"πλωτός","uri":"plôtos","senses":[{"word":"πλωτός","html":"<span class=\"entreea\"><span class=\"grec\">πλωτός,</span></span> <span class=\"des\">ή, όν</span> :\n<div class=\"rub\"><span class=\"ruba\">I</span> navigable, accessible\naux navires, <span class=\"aut\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"refch\">2,\n102 ;</span> <span class=\"aut\">Arstt.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Mir.</span> <span class=\"refch\">84 ;</span> <span class=\"aut\">Pol.</span> <span class=\"refch\">10, 48, 1 ;</span>\n<span class=\"ital\">p. suite,</span> favorable pour la navigation,\n<span class=\"aut\">Pol.</span> <span class=\"refch\">1, 37,\n10 ;</span> <span class=\"grec\">ὁ πλωτός</span> (<span class=\"ital\">s. e.</span> <span class=\"grec\">καιρός</span>) <span class=\"aut\">Héraclite gramm.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">All. Hom.</span>\n<span class=\"refch\">7</span>, la saison de la navigation ||</div>\n<div class=\"rub\"><span class=\"ruba\">II</span> flottant :\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">1</span> flottant sur l’eau,\n<span class=\"ital\">en parl. de l’î. d’Éole,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Od.</span> <span class=\"refch\">10, 3 ;</span> <span class=\"ital\">d’une île flottante,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Hdt.</span>\n<span class=\"refch\">2, 156 ;</span> <span class=\"ital\">en parl. de\ncertains poissons :</span> <span class=\"grec\">πλωτὴ\nἔγχελυς</span>, <span class=\"aut\">Ath.</span> <span class=\"refpa\">4</span><span class=\"refpb\">c</span>, <span class=\"ital\">ou</span> <span class=\"grec\">μύραινα</span>, <span class=\"aut\">Ath.</span> <span class=\"refpa\">4</span><span class=\"refpb\">c</span>, sortes d’anguille et de murène qui nagent à la\nsurface de l’eau ||</div>\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">2</span> <span class=\"ital\">p.\next.</span> qui nage, <span class=\"ital\">en gén.</span>\n<span class=\"ital\">en parl. des poissons,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Soph.</span> <span class=\"refch\">fr. 678, etc. ;</span>\n<span class=\"ital\">subst.<